stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PLACED : Checkout Submitted & Inventory Reserved

    PLACED --> PAID : Payment Confirmed (Stock retained)
    PLACED --> PAYMENT_FAILED : Payment Rejected / Gateway Error (Stock restored via compensation)
    PLACED --> CANCELLED : Customer / System Cancellation (Stock restored)

    PAID --> PACKED : Warehouse Staff Packs Items
    PAID --> CANCELLED : Permitted Administrative Cancellation (Stock restored)

    PACKED --> SHIPPED : Carrier Dispatches Package
    SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : Package Received by Customer

    PAYMENT_FAILED --> [*] : Terminal State
    CANCELLED --> [*] : Terminal State
    DELIVERED --> [*] : Terminal State

